# Secrets — .env is materialized from .env.op by `op inject` on mise enter,
# staged through a mktemp file and moved into place only on success.
# NEVER commit it. .env.op holds only 1Password references or safe literals and IS committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.op

# Generated CLI configurations are durable project state...
!.claude/
!.claude/**
!.codex/
!.codex/**
!.gemini/
!.gemini/**
!.copilot/
!.copilot/**
!.opencode/
!.opencode/**
!.kimi-code/
!.kimi-code/**
# ...but their skill projections are regenerated by `bmad-method install` and
# `mise run skills:sync`, so they stay out of the tree.
/.agents/skills/
.claude/skills/
.codex/skills/
.gemini/skills/
.copilot/skills/
.opencode/skills/
.kimi-code/skills/
